{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（6日）上午10時半左右，警方接報一名30餘歲女子倒臥在大埔海濱公園碼頭，懷疑她曾經墮海。人員到場發現事主昏迷不醒，隨即由救護車送往大埔那打素醫院搶救，其間救護員需使用自動心外壓機。警方正調查事主身份及事件。</p><figure><img alt=\"事主昏迷送院。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260806/1161993036553523200607825.jpeg/S3r9i2QbJ8SCoUYaZwnPoakTwUCFPmt15JXbBuSV2wY\"/><figcaption>事主昏迷送院。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警方正調查事主身份及事件因由。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260806/1161993039439335424418729.jpeg/biI_TxRN1d1a-j90FxWKbA6wxwP_IZ06gPMFcIDzBXA\"/><figcaption>警方正調查事主身份及事件因由。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"事主昏迷送院。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260806/1161992890969231360631250.jpeg/PgGzTKAvZKOKXrcUtlT5gLFSj0kM0QsXvCRTZbwkU2U\"/><figcaption>事主昏迷送院。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員在大埔海濱公園調查。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260806/1161996631948660736475163.jpeg/OaFc_3ZweQR6ISrGlt-x-pFVdJ-MDjSlEZfv3BGX79w\"/><figcaption>警員在大埔海濱公園調查。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"水警在大埔海濱公園對外海面巡視。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260806/1161996796663173120417682.jpeg/TupitJU7mec7xJnZfQ4ejymJj2wIni2g-_TwwN708MA\"/><figcaption>水警在大埔海濱公園對外海面巡視。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"水警在大埔海濱公園對外海面巡視。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260806/1161996799699980288724830.jpeg/WGLPWX8jqA8MkMIGuEb8TYwEQJY-LrPmx3nxdOJ58XQ\"/><figcaption>水警在大埔海濱公園對外海面巡視。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-06T03:59:54.964345+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":221,"images":6,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}